{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fQ2L7QRg0S1793345957.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本港一手私樓潛在供應，重上10萬伙水平。</p><p></p><p>房屋局公布本港未來3、4年新盤供應，截至9月底有10萬伙，按季增加4,000伙，也是連續兩個季度回升。雖然現樓貨尾維持不變，不過待售樓花按季多1,000伙，隨時可動工土地，供應也增加3,000伙。上季私樓施工量有2,800伙，按季減少五成，落成量更減少七成三，上季只有1,700伙。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:04:35.608752+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:52.447185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:15.566358+00:00","content_hash":"c408f3ee2e7ab41a8ce0ea4b6dd9f11e239c73fff0d4448a077aa9ca73942d56","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}